<title>USA: Luxottica SpA Q1 net rises to 62.7 bln lire.</title>
<headline>Luxottica SpA Q1 net rises to 62.7 bln lire.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net			 62,710		   54,661</p>
<p> Revs		     685,705		  645,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Results in millions of Italian lire.</p>
<p>Q1 income before provision for income taxes:</p>
<p>92.5 million lire vs 83.5 millioon lire.</p>
<p>1997 Q1 exchange rate: $1.00 = 1,637.8 lire.</p>
<p>1996 Q1 exchange rate: $1.00 = 1,573.4 lire.</p>
<p>Net outstanding debt as of March 31: $788.4 million vs $817.8 million at end of 1996.  </p>
<p>Q1 sales excluding LensCrafters acquisition increased 7.3 pct to 313.5 billion lire vs 292.2 billion lire in year ago period.</p>
<p>LensCrafters sales increased 7.5 percent to US$247.4 million over the comparable year ago period.</p>
</text>
